  "notes": "Fixed real bug: Conn used two socket handles (unregistered std stream for IO + try_clone registered with mio/wepoll); writes via the unregistered handle were intermittently dropped on Windows, causing echo round-trip timeouts. Now read_once/write_vectored prefer conn.mio_tcp (the poll-registered handle); eventloop arms WRITABLE when on_traffic leaves outbound data pending. protocol.rs already had 7 codec unit tests; none added per task rule."
